A confirmation message to an instruction response containing the confirmed values that will be taken into consideration. </Definition>
</CodeDescription>
</xsd:documentation>
</xsd:annotation>
</xsd:enumeration>
<xsd:enumeration value="ALH">
<xsd:annotation>
<xsd:documentation>
<CodeDescription>
<Title>ALH</Title>
